            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">Black chrome coating with nickel underlay. Alkaline cleaning of copper to remove any oils on the surface. Neutralizing with the acid to remove any oxidation. Plating nickel on copper. Plating black chrome on the nickel plated copper. Wash and dry.\n\n# Included processes\nGate to gate inventory for the process including infrastructure, wastes, effluents. Not including packages.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
